# Material Flow Simulator layout
# POPUP n page colour title / POPUPTEXT n text
# PAGE name / LAYERS count active / LAYER n visible locked name / ON layer
# CELL x y kind conn dia dir open strength
# STOCK x y water oil fluff sand air% feed%
# BUCKET x y w h
# LABEL x y text   (\n = new line)
# LABEL2 kind x y colour box format caption   (kind text/date/time, \s = space)
# FRAME x y w h colour dashed fill carry title
# LINK x y colour page|popup n caption
# EQUIP kind x y w h state flip linkx linky level name
# ECELL x y kind conn dir pos npos sel on tripped p1 p2 tag ref src p3
# FLOW n kind x y w h op act next no value src target caption   (next / no: node n, 0 = none)
# FLOWX n type low period   (a random node: 0 boolean, 1 byte, 2 integer, 3 float)
MFLOW 2
NAME Flow chart: switches & random
POPUP 1 2 2 How it works
POPUPTEXT 1 COIN (a random boolean, every 2 s) turns\nswitch S1 and air valve V1 on or off. LOAD\n(a random byte) over 235 trips OL1; after 3 s\nthe chart resets it. DICE (1..3) sets the\nposition of selector SA1 (H3 in position 3).
POPUP 2 0 3 Try this
POPUPTEXT 2 Set COIN's True % (Properties) to 100.\nChange Overload?'s value: fewer trips.\nPoint Speed > 50? at another name.

PAGE Plant
LAYERS 5 1
LAYER 1 1 0 Process
LAYER 2 1 0 Notes
LAYER 3 1 0 Flow chart
LAYER 4 1 0 Electrical
LAYER 5 1 0 Pneumatic
GRAVITY 1.00
ON 1
ON 2
